# Lombard Street's crooked block (city phase 12): the brick lane winding down from Hyde to
# Leavenworth between the flower beds, level across, 16 % along. The rider-line autopilot
# (lombard_crooked_line) rides it from the top at Hyde at 5 m/s, braking down the hill, round all
# eight hairpins to the foot of the block: no bail, still on the lane.
park sf
spawn lombard_crooked
cmd 0 traffic clear
bot line lombard_crooked_line 6
run 4000
expect skater.pos.x > -160 at end
expect no event bail
